<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to ParcelFlow</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Sora:wght@600;700&display=swap');

        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #EEF2F7;
            font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #1A2340;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .wrapper {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 48px auto;
            padding: 0 16px 48px;
        }

        .header {
            background: #0F2057;
            border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
            padding: 28px 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .logo-mark {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            background: #3B82F6;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .logo-mark svg {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            fill: #fff;
        }

        .logo-text {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }

        .logo-text span {
            color: #60A5FA;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A3A8F 0%, #0F2057 60%, #0A1640 100%);
            padding: 44px 40px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -40px;
            right: -40px;
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .hero::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -30px;
            left: -30px;
            width: 130px;
            height: 130px;
            background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.08);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .hero-icon {
            width: 68px;
            height: 68px;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18);
            border: 2px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.35);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-icon svg {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            fill: #60A5FA;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-sub {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #93B8F5;
            line-height: 1.6;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px 40px 36px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0F2057;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .intro {
            font-size: 14.5px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #4A5578;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .features-title {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8A94B2;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .feature-item {
            background: #F8FAFF;
            border: 1px solid #E4ECFF;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 16px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .feature-icon svg {
            width: 17px;
            height: 17px;
        }

        .fi-blue {
            background: #EBF2FF;
        }

        .fi-blue svg {
            fill: #3B82F6;
        }

        .fi-green {
            background: #EDFAF4;
        }

        .fi-green svg {
            fill: #10B981;
        }

        .fi-amber {
            background: #FFF7EA;
        }

        .fi-amber svg {
            fill: #F59E0B;
        }

        .fi-purple {
            background: #F3EEFF;
        }

        .fi-purple svg {
            fill: #8B5CF6;
        }

        .feature-label {
            font-size: 12.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1A2340;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .feature-desc {
            font-size: 11.5px;
            color: #8A94B2;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .cta-wrap {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .cta-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #0F2057;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 36px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 0.2px;
        }

        .divider {
            border: none;
            border-top: 1px solid #E8EDF5;
            margin: 0 0 28px;
        }

        .support-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: flex-start;
            background: #F0F5FF;
            border: 1px solid #D4E3FF;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 16px;
        }

        .support-icon {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        .support-text {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #3A4D7A;
        }

        .support-text strong {
            display: block;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #0F2057;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .support-text a {
            color: #3B82F6;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #F5F7FC;
            border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;
            padding: 24px 40px;
            border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F5;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-text {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #8A94B2;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .footer-brand {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #0F2057;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .wrapper {
                margin: 16px auto;
            }

            .header,
            .card,
            .footer {
                padding-left: 24px;
                padding-right: 24px;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 32px 24px;
            }

            .hero-title {
                font-size: 21px;
            }

            .features {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="wrapper">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo-mark">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path
                        d="M20 8h-3V4H3c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v11h2c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3h6c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3h2v-5l-3-4zm-1.5 1.5L20.46 12H17V9.5h1.5zM6 18c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1s.45-1 1-1 1 .45 1 1-.45 1-1 1zm2.22-3c-.55-.61-1.33-1-2.22-1s-1.67.39-2.22 1H3V6h12v9H8.22zm9.78 3c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1s.45-1 1-1 1 .45 1 1-.45 1-1 1z" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="logo-text">Parcel<span>Flow</span></span>
        </div>

        <!-- Hero -->
        <div class="hero">
            <div class="hero-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path
                        d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">You're officially verified! 🎉</h1>
            <p class="hero-sub">
                Your merchant account is active and ready to go.<br />
                Start managing deliveries with ParcelFlow today.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card -->
        <div class="card">
            <p class="greeting">Welcome aboard, <%= name %>!</p>
            <p class="intro">
                We're thrilled to have you as a ParcelFlow merchant. Your account has been
                verified and is fully set up. You now have everything you need to start
                booking parcels, tracking shipments, and managing your deliveries — all in one place.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p class="footer-text">
                © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <span class="footer-brand">ParcelFlow</span>. All rights
                    reserved.<br />
                    Connecting merchants and riders across Bangladesh.<br />
                    <a href="https://parcelflow.com/unsubscribe"
                        style="color:#8A94B2; text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a>
                    &nbsp;·&nbsp;
                    <a href="https://parcelflow.com/privacy" style="color:#8A94B2; text-decoration:underline;">Privacy
                        Policy</a>
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>

</html>